#: ../../tokens.md:1
msgid "Tokens and languages"
msgstr "Ama-token nezilimi"

#: ../../tokens.md:3
msgid ""
"Models do not read words. They read tokens, which are pieces of text. You"
" pay for tokens, your `max_tokens` limit is measured in tokens, and "
"longer token counts take longer to process. So it helps to know how many "
"tokens your text will use before you send it."
msgstr ""
"Amamodeli awafundi amagama. Afunda ama-token, okuyizingxenye zombhalo. "
"Ukhokhela ama-token, umkhawulo wakho we-`max_tokens` ulinganiswa ngama-"
"token, futhi inani elikhulu lama-token lithatha isikhathi eside "
"ukucutshungulwa. Ngakho kuyasiza ukwazi ukuthi umbhalo wakho uzosebenzisa "
"ama-token amangaki ngaphambi kokuwuthumela."

#: ../../tokens.md:5
msgid "Why the same idea can cost different amounts"
msgstr "Kungani umqondo ofanayo ungase usebenzise amanani ahlukene"

#: ../../tokens.md:7
msgid ""
"A tokenizer that was built mostly around English text often cuts words "
"from other languages into more pieces. The same sentence in two languages"
" can therefore use a different number of tokens, even when the meaning is"
" identical. If you build for several languages, check token counts for "
"each one instead of assuming they match."
msgstr ""
"I-tokenizer eyakhiwe kakhulu ngokusekelwe embhalweni wesiNgisi ivame "
"ukuhlukanisa amagama ezinye izilimi abe yizingxenye eziningi. Ngakho-ke, "
"umusho ofanayo ngezilimi ezimbili ungase usebenzise inani elihlukile "
"lama-token, noma incazelo ifana. Uma wakhela izilimi eziningi, hlola "
"izibalo zama-token zolunye nolunye ulimi esikhundleni sokucabanga ukuthi "
"ziyalingana."

#: ../../tokens.md:9
msgid "Count tokens before you send"
msgstr "Bala ama-token ngaphambi kokuthumela"

#: ../../tokens.md:11
msgid "`POST /v1/tokens/count` returns the token count for a piece of text."
msgstr "`POST /v1/tokens/count` ibuyisa inani lama-token esiqeshini sombhalo."

#: ../../tokens.md:14
msgid ""
"Lugha uses a deliberately simple tokenizer. It cuts every word into "
"pieces of at most four characters. That makes results easy to explain and"
" reproduce. It does not describe how any real model counts tokens, so "
"treat the numbers below as a demonstration of the endpoint, not a "
"measurement."
msgstr ""
"I-Lugha isebenzisa i-tokenizer elula ngamabomu. Ihlukanisa igama ngalinye "
"libe izingxenye ezinobukhulu obungaphezu kwezinhlamvu ezine. Lokhu kwenza "
"imiphumela ibe lula ukuyichaza nokuyiphinda. Ayichazi ukuthi imodeli "
"yangempela ibala kanjani ama-token, ngakho-ke phatha izinombolo ezingezansi "
"njengomboniso we-endpoint, hhayi njengesilinganiso."

#: ../../tokens.md:17
msgid "Count an English sentence:"
msgstr "Bala ama-token omusho wesiNgisi:"

#: ../../tokens.md:30
msgid "Now a Swahili sentence:"
msgstr "Manje umusho wesiSwahili:"

#: ../../tokens.md:43
msgid "`token_count`"
msgstr "`token_count`"

#: ../../tokens.md:44
msgid "The number of tokens in the text."
msgstr "Inani lama-token akumbhalo."

#: ../../tokens.md:46
msgid "`word_count`"
msgstr "`word_count`"

#: ../../tokens.md:47
msgid "The number of words, split on whitespace."
msgstr "Inani lamagama, ahlukaniswe ngezikhala."

#: ../../tokens.md:49
msgid "`tokens_per_word`"
msgstr "`tokens_per_word`"

#: ../../tokens.md:50
msgid ""
"`token_count` divided by `word_count`, rounded to two decimals. Use it to"
" compare texts of different lengths."
msgstr ""
"`token_count` ehlukaniswe nge-`word_count`, bese isondezwa ibe namadesimali"
" amabili. Yisebenzise ukuqhathanisa imibhalo enobude obuhlukene."

#: ../../tokens.md:52
msgid "How tokens show up elsewhere"
msgstr "Ama-token avela kanjani kwezinye izindawo"

#: ../../tokens.md:54
msgid ""
"The `usage` object in a `/v1/generate` response reports the same counts "
"for a real request: `prompt_tokens` for what you sent and "
"`completion_tokens` for what came back."
msgstr ""
"I-object ye-`usage` ku-response ye-`/v1/generate` ibika izibalo ezifanayo "
"ze-request yangempela: `prompt_tokens` yalokho okuthumele kanye "
"`completion_tokens` yalokho okubuyile."

#: ../../tokens.md:56
msgid ""
"`max_tokens` limits `completion_tokens` only. It does not include your "
"prompt. If the model reaches the limit, the response ends with "
"`finish_reason` set to `length`."
msgstr ""
"`max_tokens` ibeka umkhawulo ku-`completion_tokens` kuphela. Ayifaki "
"i-prompt yakho. Uma imodeli ifinyelela emkhawulweni, i-response iphela "
"i-`finish_reason` isethwe ku-`length`."

#: ../../tokens.md:58
msgid ""
"Count your prompt first if you want to estimate the size of a request "
"before you make it."
msgstr ""
"Bala ama-token e-prompt yakho kuqala uma ufuna ukulinganisa ubukhulu "
"be-request ngaphambi kokuyithumela."